+- `nova_poshta.py`
+
+## Frontend Boundaries
+
+Current frontend scope already present in the repository:
+
+- app bootstrap
+- router shell
+- auth API client
+- auth store and hook
+- base UI primitives
+
+Planned but not yet present in the repository:
+
+- dedicated page modules
